<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n58708" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κολοφών</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῶνος</span>,
			ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>summit, top, finishing</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κολοφῶνα ἐπιτιθέναι</span> put <i>the finishing
			touch</i> to . . , <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Euthd.</u>
				301e
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Lg.</u>
				673d
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν κ. προσβιβάζειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Tht.</u>
					153c
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. ἐπάγειν τῷ λόγῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ael.
					<u>NA</u>
					13.12
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κολοφὼν ἐπὶ τῷ λόγῳ εἰρήσθω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					674c
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. τοῦ λόγου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Com.Adesp.</u>
					433
				</span></i>
			; later <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. τῆς ἀσεβείας</span>
			<i>height</i> of impiety, <i><span class="en">
				Jul.
				<u>Gal.</u>
				333c
			</span></i>; of persons, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ κ. τῆς
			ἀδικίας</span> the <i>arch</i>-criminal, <i><span class="en">
				Lib.
				<u>Decl.</u>
				30.12
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν ἀτοπημάτων κ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Zos.
					4.15
				</span></i>
			. (Expld. by <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				14.1.28
			</span></i> from the belief that the cavalry of Colophon was so
			excellent that it always decided the contest.) </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> sort of <i>ball</i> for playing with, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.526e
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κολοιός</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> kind of <i>sea-fish</i>,
			Id.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
